Copyleft — these carry obligations when a combined work is redistributed:
  * SimQN            — GPL-3.0           © QNLab, USTC
  * wgephemeralpeer  — GPL-3.0           © Mullvad VPN AB
  * qkdnetsim        — GPL-2.0           © QKDNetSim authors
